    {
      "name": "Potion of Swimming",
      "type": "mastercrafted.mastercrafted",
      "text": {
        "content": "<p>The potion is made of layers of teal, light blue, and indigo fluid that resemble a deep ocean. Shaking the bottle fails to mix the colors.\n\nWhen you drink this potion, you gain a swimming speed equal to your walking speed for 1 hour. During this time, you have advantage on Strength (Athletics) checks you make to swim.</p>",
